Note on data: this repository ships no dictionary data. The dictionaries that
`moguru data download` fetches are governed by their own licenses — JMdict /
JMnedict / KANJIDIC2 / kradfile (EDRDG; JMdict under CC BY-SA 4.0), kanjium
pitch accents, JPDB v2.2 + BCCWJ-derived frequency lists (Yomitan-format
releases by Kuuuube), and UniDic (NINJAL). Attribute them accordingly if you
redistribute derived data.
